trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Assign additional instructors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can assign a new instructor by writing in the  text box the new instructor's username. The autocompletion functionality will list all the users matching those letters.&lt;br/&gt;
Instructors will be able to upload new training resources, enroll additional users and consult the reporting data for the course.&lt;br/&gt;
Existing users can be upgraded to instructor in the course.&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Assign additional instructors&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You can assign a new instructor by writing in the  text box the new instructor's username. The autocompletion functionality will list all the users matching those letters.&lt;br/&gt;
Instructors will be able to upload new training resources, enroll additional users and consult the reporting data for the course.&lt;br/&gt;
Existing users can be upgraded to instructor in the course.&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Course creation and enrollment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After creating the users, you can create a new course.&lt;br/&gt;
Once a new course is created you can enroll learners in it.&lt;br/&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Course creation and enrollment&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After creating the users, you can create a new course.&lt;br/&gt;
Once a new course is created you can enroll learners in it.&lt;br/&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Create new user&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need to create a new user, type its email address and click Add: this step will trigger the user creation process. After his creation you can enroll the user in a course.&lt;br/&gt;
Note: The new user username will be the user's email address&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Create new user&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you need to create a new user, type its email address and click Add: this step will trigger the user creation process. After his creation you can enroll the user in a course.&lt;br/&gt;
Note: The new user username will be the user's email address&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Edit - Delete users&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clicking on the Edit icon will allow to edit the user details (and also to change the user's password)&lt;br/&gt;
By clicking on the Delete icon, the user will be deleted permanently from the system and will have no longer access to the e-learning platform.&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Edit - Delete users&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Clicking on the Edit icon will allow to edit the user details (and also to change the user's password)&lt;br/&gt;
By clicking on the Delete icon, the user will be deleted permanently from the system and will have no longer access to the e-learning platform.&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Enroll users in a course&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The users with the active checkbox have previously been enrolled in the course. You can enroll (and unenroll) additional users by clicking on the corresponding checkbox.&lt;br/&gt;
(Please note that the Delete icon will delete the users from the platform)&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Enroll users in a course&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The users with the active checkbox have previously been enrolled in the course. You can enroll (and unenroll) additional users by clicking on the corresponding checkbox.&lt;br/&gt;
(Please note that the Delete icon will delete the users from the platform)&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Enroll users in a course&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By clicking here, you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;the list of the users previously enrolled in this course
&lt;p&gt;the possibility to add additional users to this course (users shall be created in the system prior to this step)&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Enroll users in a course&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By clicking here, you will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;the list of the users previously enrolled in this course
&lt;p&gt;the possibility to add additional users to this course (users shall be created in the system prior to this step)&lt;/p&gt;

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Advanced settings &lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this section you will be able to access to the advanced settings of the system : &lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Localization tool&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the management of the languages in the system&lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Template manager&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the management of the user interface look and feel&lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise view&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the enterprise version of the system, which gives access to more advanced functionalities. When you switch to &quot;enterprise view&quot; you will always be able to roll-back to the &quot;simplified view&quot; from this same window.

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Advanced settings &lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this section you will be able to access to the advanced settings of the system : &lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Localization tool&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the management of the languages in the system&lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Template manager&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the management of the user interface look and feel&lt;br/&gt;
- the &lt;strong&gt;Enterprise view&lt;/strong&gt; will enable the enterprise version of the system, which gives access to more advanced functionalities. When you switch to &quot;enterprise view&quot; you will always be able to roll-back to the &quot;simplified view&quot; from this same window.

trans-unit.source:
&lt;h2&gt;Navigation policy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose between 4 navigation policies:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Free navigation:&lt;/b&gt; Learners can navigate freely among the course’s training materials&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Sequential navigation:&lt;/b&gt; Learners must complete and pass the training materials in the sequential order set in the Training material tab &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Final training material locked:&lt;/b&gt; Learners must complete all of the training materials in the course in order to unlock the last training material&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Completion of the first mandatory training material:&lt;/b&gt; Learners can access the training materials of the course only after they have completed and passed the first training material in the list. They will be then able to view the other training material either in their preferred order or in the sequential order set for the course.

trans-unit.target:
&lt;h2&gt;Navigation policy&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Choose between 4 navigation policies:&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Free navigation:&lt;/b&gt; Learners can navigate freely among the course’s training materials&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Sequential navigation:&lt;/b&gt; Learners must complete and pass the training materials in the sequential order set in the Training material tab &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Final training material locked:&lt;/b&gt; Learners must complete all of the training materials in the course in order to unlock the last training material&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Completion of the first mandatory training material:&lt;/b&gt; Learners can access the training materials of the course only after they have completed and passed the first training material in the list. They will be then able to view the other training material either in their preferred order or in the sequential order set for the course.

