trans-unit.source:
By migrating the custom reports from the old Reports menu to the New Reports menu, you'll be able to view and edit your reports using the new features available for the New Custom Reports. Only the reports created after January 1, 2019 will be migrated.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;
Please note that the following configurations will be migrated:
&lt;ul&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Properties&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Visibility&lt;/li&gt;
  &lt;li&gt;- Filters&lt;/li&gt;
 &lt;li&gt;- Report fields&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
but the schedules configured for the report &lt;b&gt;won't be migrated&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; 
&lt;b&gt;Remember that, if you migrate the same report more than once, all of the changes you made to the migrated report will be overwritten.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;

