trans-unit.source:
In this interface you can copy one or more parts of Docebo CSS (Cascading stylesheet classes) in the text box. You can find the list of the existing classes at the bottom of the page. You can download them for editing, and once modified, copy them in this text box to apply modifications to the layout of the system &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
After that, you can also save a copy of your custom CSS and download it locally&lt;br/&gt;
CSS modifications may override color schemes applied outside of the CSS via the template manager functionalities &lt;br/&gt;
If you want to roll back to the default system CSS version, simply empty the text field and save.

trans-unit.target:
In this interface you can copy one or more parts of Docebo CSS (Cascading stylesheet classes) in the text box. You can find the list of the existing classes at the bottom of the page. You can download them for editing, and once modified, copy them in this text box to apply modifications to the layout of the system &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
After that, you can also save a copy of your custom CSS and download it locally&lt;br/&gt;
CSS modifications may override color schemes applied outside of the CSS via the template manager functionalities &lt;br/&gt;
If you want to roll back to the default system CSS version, simply empty the text field and save.

trans-unit.source:
Greetings from Docebo,&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Things are going well with your Docebo e-learning platform! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
It looks like the large majority of your active users has already logged in Docebo! &lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
As we want to make sure that we keep you posted about  what’s going on in your system, we will notify you again when your  active users cap is reached !&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Please do bear in mind that extra users accessing your Docebo platform will be billed separately at a cost of $4.50 each.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Based on the above, you can consider upgrading your existing users plan, if that makes things convenient for you.&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
We appreciate your business, thanks for being a Docebo customer!&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;br/&gt;
Thanks!&lt;br/&gt;
The Docebo team&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.docebo.com&quot;&gt;www.docebo.com&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;

